"""UNBOUND/UNRUN one-use37 synthetic front guard tests; no child or native launch.

ROOT must supervise the owned direct base-Python process for <=60 seconds,
kill/wait and preserve exclusive stdout/stderr captures on every outcome.
This driver has no built-in process timeout or descendant-cleanup claim.
"""
